Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.79,0:00:04.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, this sandwich is an unmitigated disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.79,0:00:04.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这份三明治简直太不像话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:06.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I asked for turkey and roast beef...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:06.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要的是火鸡加烤牛肉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.34,0:00:09.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...with lettuce and Swiss on whole wheat. -What'd they give you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.34,0:00:09.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-加生菜和瑞士芝士 用全麦面包 -结果他们给的你什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:13.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Turkey and roast beef with Swiss and lettuce on whole wheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.18,0:00:13.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}火鸡加烤牛肉 瑞士芝士和生菜 用全麦面包
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:21.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's the right ingredients but in the wrong order.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:21.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}材料正确 但排列顺序错误
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.15,0:00:25.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In a proper sandwich, the cheese is adjacent to the bread...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.15,0:00:25.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}正确的三明治排列是芝士要挨着面包
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:28.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to create a moisture barrier against the lettuce.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:28.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好让生菜的湿气不碰触到面包
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.07,0:00:32.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They might as well have dragged this thing through a car wash.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.07,0:00:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们还不如把这东西拖过洗车间呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:36.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I don't believe it. -I know. It's basic culinary science.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:36.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真不敢相信 -是啊 这是基本的烹调科学
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.45,0:00:39.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Some guy is auctioning off a miniature time-machine prop...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.45,0:00:39.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人在网上拍卖一台迷你时光机道具
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.33,0:00:41.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...from the original film and no one is bidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.33,0:00:41.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当初拍电影用的 但竟然没人出价
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:44.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A time machine from the movie The Time Machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:44.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}电影《时光机》里的时光机？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.13,0:00:47.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, a time machine from Sophie's Choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.13,0:00:47.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 是《苏菲的选择》里的时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.17,0:00:51.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boy, Sophie could have used a time machine in that movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.17,0:00:51.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}苏菲在那部电影里真该使用时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.18,0:00:53.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you see it? It's rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.18,0:00:53.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有看过吗？很悲壮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.55,0:00:54.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Oh, that's cool. LEONARD: Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.55,0:00:54.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（独一无二拍卖网）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.76,0:00:57.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's only $800? -Yeah. And that's my bid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.76,0:00:57.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好酷 -只要800美元？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.31,0:01:01.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You bid $800? -It was a spur-of-the-moment thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.31,0:00:59.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 那是我出的价
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.06,0:01:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你出价800美元？ -我一时冲动出价的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:05.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I figured it would go for thousands, and I just wanted to be a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:05.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为会冲上好几千块 我只想参与玩玩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:08.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-There's only 30 seconds left in the auction. -Do you have $800?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:08.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-拍卖只剩30秒就结束了 -你有800美元吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.86,0:01:12.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Not to blow on a miniature time machine. -Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.86,0:01:12.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-也不能浪费在迷你时光机上啊 -别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.24,0:01:15.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}People wait until the last second, then they get it. It's called sniping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.24,0:01:15.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有些人总等到最后一秒才出价 这叫狙击
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.78,0:01:19.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Fifteen seconds. -Come on, snipers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.78,0:01:19.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-还有15秒 -快点呀 狙击手们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.12,0:01:23.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Ten, nine, eight-- -Where are your snipers?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.12,0:01:23.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-十、九、八… -你说的狙击手呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:25.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Five. -Snipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:25.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-五 -狙击
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.71,0:01:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Four. -Snipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.71,0:01:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-四 -狙击
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.96,0:01:28.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Three, two. -Snipe, snipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.96,0:01:28.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-三、二 -狙击
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.09,0:01:30.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-One. -Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.09,0:01:30.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.72,0:01:36.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Congratulations, you are the proud owner of a miniature time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.72,0:01:36.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恭喜你成为迷你时光机骄傲的主人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.35,0:01:37.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You lucky duck. LEONARD: Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.35,0:01:37.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真走运
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.14,0:01:39.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I wonder why no one else bid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.14,0:01:39.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不知道为什么没人出价
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:42.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is a classic piece of sci-fi movie memorabilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:42.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这可是经典科幻片的纪念品
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.39,0:01:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. But I still can't afford it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.39,0:01:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道 但我还是买不起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.65,0:01:47.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't we share it? We'll each put in 200 bucks...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.65,0:01:47.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们何不一起出钱买？每个人出200美元
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:51.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...and take turns having it in our house. -A time-share time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:51.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-然后大家在房间轮流把玩 -分时共享的时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:55.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm in. Sheldon? -Wha--? Need you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.36,0:01:55.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我要！谢尔顿呢？ -什么？还用问吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.62,0:01:57.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I still don't understand why no one else bid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.62,0:01:57.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可我仍不明白为什么没人出价
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.21,0:02:09.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I understand why no one else bid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.21,0:02:09.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我现在明白为什么没人出价了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.91,0:02:39.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did the listing actually say "miniature"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.91,0:02:39.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}商品信息真的有注明“迷你”吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.54,0:02:43.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just assumed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.54,0:02:43.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我以为是迷你的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.96,0:02:48.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, who sells a full-sized time machine for $800?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.96,0:02:48.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}实物大小的时光机谁会只卖800美元呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.54,0:02:51.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In a Venn diagram, that would be an individual located...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.54,0:02:51.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果用范恩图解的话 就会有一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.38,0:02:54.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...within the intersection of "no longer want time machine"...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.38,0:02:54.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在“出让时光机”和“需要800美元”两个集合的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:57.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and "need $800."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:57.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}交集中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:02:59.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's actually a tremendous bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:02:59.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这其实挺便宜的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.55,0:03:03.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Even with shipping, it works out to less than $4 a pound.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.55,0:03:03.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}即便加上运费 每磅还不到4美元
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.98,0:03:06.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Cocktail shrimp are 12.50.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.98,0:03:06.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一磅冷虾就要12块5美元
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:11.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How are we gonna get it upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:11.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要如何把它弄上楼呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.90,0:03:14.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If we take the dish off, it might fit in the elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.90,0:03:14.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果把碟子拆下来 或许能塞进电梯里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.78,0:03:17.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but the elevator's been broken for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.78,0:03:17.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 可是电梯已经坏了两年了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.45,0:03:21.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've been meaning to ask you, do you think we should make a call about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.45,0:03:21.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一直想问你 我们是不是应该打电话叫人来修？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.74,0:03:25.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not necessary. I have a Master's in engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.74,0:03:25.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用了 我有工程硕士学位
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.75,0:03:28.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I remotely repair satellites on a regular basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.75,0:03:28.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我经常进行远距离卫星修复
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.79,0:03:32.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I troubleshoot space-shuttle payloads.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.79,0:03:32.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}航天飞机运载舱问题都由我解决
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:34.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When the Mars rover started pulling to the left...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:34.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当火星探测车开始往左倾时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.84,0:03:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I performed a front-end alignment from 62 million miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.84,0:03:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我从一亿公里之外进行前轮定位矫正
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.14,0:03:45.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（故障 小心）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.73,0:03:51.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, that baby's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.73,0:03:51.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有用 那玩意是坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.28,0:03:55.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Come on, guys, push.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.28,0:03:55.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}加油 大家用力推
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.78,0:03:59.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: If I push any harder, I'm gonna give birth to my colon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.78,0:03:59.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我再用力推的话我的大肠就要被推出来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.16,0:04:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RAJESH: I can't feel my fingers. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.16,0:04:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的手指麻掉了 快点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:05.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's the same amount of work, no matter how fast you go. Basic physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:05.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无论动作多快 费的力还是一样多 这是基础物理学知识
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.58,0:04:06.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RAJESH: Sheldon. -Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.58,0:04:06.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 -什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.96,0:04:11.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RAJESH: If my fingers ever work again, I've got a job for the middle one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.96,0:04:11.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的手指若能再动的话 我要好好用用我的中指
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:13.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, hey, guys. -Hi, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:14.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 各位 -嗨 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.67,0:04:14.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[RAJESH AND HOWARD SCREAM]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.26,0:04:19.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Take a break, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.26,0:04:19.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家休息一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.97,0:04:23.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What are you doing? -Just moving something upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.97,0:04:23.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们在做什么呢？ -只是要搬个东西上楼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.64,0:04:28.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What is it? -Just, you know, a time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.64,0:04:28.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么东西？ -也就一台时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:30.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, neat. But I really gotta get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:30.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 真好 但我得去上班了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.69,0:04:33.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Just give us a few minutes. -I'm running really late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.69,0:04:33.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-给我们几分钟 -我快要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:35.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then I have a simple solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:35.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我有个简单的解决办法
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.36,0:04:38.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Go up to the roof, hop over to the next building-- There's a gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.36,0:04:38.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}到屋顶上 跳过隔壁大楼…中间只有一点缝隙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.53,0:04:42.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't look down if you're subject to vertigo. --and use their stairwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.53,0:04:42.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你容易晕眩就别往下看 然后走他们的楼梯下去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.62,0:04:46.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You're joking, right? -Oh, I never joke when it comes to vertigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.62,0:04:46.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你在开玩笑 对吧？ -我从来不拿晕眩开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.41,0:04:50.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Damn. Okay, I'll just take the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.41,0:04:50.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我只好从屋顶走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:53.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you wait for us to set up the time machine...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.96,0:04:53.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你能等一下 等我们设定好时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:55.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I can drop you off at work yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:55.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就可以送你到昨天上班的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:04:59.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Time-travel joke. It's not-- Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:04:59.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}时光旅行的笑话 没有…算了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.01,0:05:04.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For what it's worth, I thought it was humorous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.01,0:05:05.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过我倒觉得挺幽默的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.68,0:05:05.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CHORTLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.35,0:05:09.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's just do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.35,0:05:09.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}咱们还是来搬吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.85,0:05:12.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You guys ready to push? RAJESH: In a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.85,0:05:12.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们准备好推了吗？ -等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.56,0:05:15.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard stepped outside to throw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.56,0:05:15.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德到外面去吐了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.11,0:05:24.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know what you were worried about. I think it really works in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.11,0:05:24.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不懂你们担心什么 我觉得放在这里刚刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.28,0:05:29.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. It is by far the coolest thing I have ever owned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.28,0:05:29.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 这是我拥有过的最酷的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:32.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The exact time machine that carried actor Rod Taylor...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:32.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}曾载过演员罗德泰勒的时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.21,0:05:35.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...from Victorian England into the post-apocalyptic future...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.21,0:05:35.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从英国的维多利亚时代到后启示时代的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.21,0:05:37.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...where society had splintered into two factions:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.21,0:05:37.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}整个世界分裂成两大族：
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:39.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}the subterranean Morlocks...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:39.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}穴居的莫洛克族
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.17,0:05:43.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who survived by feasting on the flesh of the gentle surface-dwelling Eloi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.17,0:05:43.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}靠吞噬居住在地面上性情温和的依洛族维生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.05,0:05:48.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Talk about your chick magnets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.05,0:05:48.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这可是超级泡妞武器
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.64,0:05:52.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, yeah. The guy who lives next to me is always like:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.64,0:05:52.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 住我隔壁的那个家伙老爱说：
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:56.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"I have a Jacuzzi on my balcony. I have a Jacuzzi on my balcony."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:56.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“我的阳台上有个按摩浴缸…”
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.27,0:06:00.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But wait until I tell him I've got a time machine on my balcony.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.27,0:06:00.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等我告诉他我阳台上有时光机 他就得意不起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.57,0:06:04.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stuff that in your Speedos, Jacuzzi Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.57,0:06:04.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去你的三角泳裤 按摩浴缸先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.32,0:06:07.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gentlemen, we said we'd take turns...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.32,0:06:07.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 我知道我们说了轮流用
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.24,0:06:10.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I think you'll agree that practicality dictates it remain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.24,0:06:10.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我想大家都同意实际情况决定了它应该留在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.95,0:06:13.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't keep it. What if I meet a girl and say:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.95,0:06:13.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不能一直放在这里 万一我对泡到的女孩说：
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.42,0:06:16.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"You wanna see my time machine? It's at my friend's house."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.42,0:06:16.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“想不想看我的时光机？它就在我朋友家”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:18.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How lame is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:18.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那有多差劲？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.59,0:06:20.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-He's got a point. SHELDON: All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.59,0:06:20.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他说得有道理 -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.30,0:06:24.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're going to need some ground rules. "No shoes in the time machine."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.30,0:06:24.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们需要定下基本规矩：“不得穿鞋进入时光机”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.09,0:06:26.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"No eating in the time machine." I propose that we add:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.09,0:06:26.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“不得在时光机内进食” 我提议我们加上一条：
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:30.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Pants must be worn at all times in the time machine."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:30.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“在时光机里时 自始至终都要穿着裤子”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.89,0:06:32.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Seconded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.89,0:06:32.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.10,0:06:35.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was gonna put down a towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.10,0:06:35.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我原先打算放条浴巾的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.61,0:06:42.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I still want it on my balcony. I say we move it on a bimonthly basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.61,0:06:42.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还是要把它摆在我的阳台上 我建议双月搬动一次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.69,0:06:45.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That sounds fair. -Hold on. Bimonthly is an ambiguous term.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.69,0:06:45.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-挺公平的 -等一下 “双月”一词模棱两可
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:48.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Every other month or twice a month? -Twice a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:48.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是每隔一月 还是每月两次？ -每月两次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.62,0:06:50.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Then no. -Okay, every other month.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.62,0:06:50.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那不成 -好吧 那就每隔一月
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.78,0:06:52.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.78,0:06:52.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.08,0:06:54.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, you can't be selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.08,0:06:54.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你不能这么自私
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.71,0:06:57.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We all paid for it, so it belongs to all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.71,0:06:57.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们都有出钱 所以它是属于大家的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.21,0:07:00.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now get out of the way so I can sit in my time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.21,0:07:00.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快闪开 我要坐进我的时光机里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.80,0:07:06.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[ALL GASPING]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:14.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. I am setting the dials for March 10th, 1876.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:14.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我要把时间设定在1876年3月10日
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.06,0:07:17.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good choice. Alexander Graham Bell invents the telephone and calls for Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.06,0:07:17.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好日子 这天亚历山大贝尔发明电话 并且打电话给华生博士
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.81,0:07:21.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Wait a minute. I wanna see that too. -So when it's your turn, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.81,0:07:21.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-等一下 我也要看 -轮到你的时候 你再去看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.48,0:07:25.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If we all go back to the same time, Bell's lab's going to get very crowded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.48,0:07:25.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可是如果我们全都同时回到那个时候 贝尔的实验室会变得很挤
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.15,0:07:27.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He'll know something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.15,0:07:27.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他会察觉事有蹊跷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.32,0:07:29.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Since the time machine doesn't move in space...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.32,0:07:29.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再说 时光机不能做空间移动
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:32.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...you'll end up in 1876 Pasadena. -Even if you make it to Boston...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:32.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你将会回到1876年的帕萨迪纳 -就算你能回到波士顿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.99,0:07:36.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...what are you gonna do? Knock and say to Mrs. Bell, "Fan of your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.99,0:07:36.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你又能做什么？敲门对贝尔太太说： “我是你老公的粉丝…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.66,0:07:39.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I come in and watch him invent the telephone?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.66,0:07:39.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以进来看他发明电话吗？”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.67,0:07:42.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mrs. Bell was deaf. She's not even gonna hear you knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.67,0:07:42.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}贝尔太太是聋子 她不会听到你敲门
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.67,0:07:46.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have a solution. First, go into the future...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.67,0:07:46.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有个办法 首先 去未来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.17,0:07:49.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...and obtain a cloaking device. -Ooh. How far into the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.17,0:07:49.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-获得一个隐形器 -多远的未来？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:52.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I remember, Kirk will steal a cloaking device from the Romulans...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.26,0:07:52.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我没记错的话 柯克船长 将在星际日期5027,3从罗慕伦人手中
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.85,0:07:55.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...on stardate 5027.3...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.85,0:07:55.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}偷到一个隐形器
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:59.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which would be January 10th, 2328, by pre-Federation reckoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根据前联邦推算也就是2328年1月10日
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.36,0:08:05.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I am setting the dials for January 10th, 2328.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.36,0:08:05.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 我就把日期设定在2328年1月10日
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.36,0:08:08.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here we go into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.36,0:08:08.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们要进入未来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:30.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:31.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LAUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:33.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:33.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}该我了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:38.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, first of all, what you call a gap was nearly three feet wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:38.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 首先 你说的缝隙将近有一米宽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.27,0:08:40.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I slipped and skinned my knee. -Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.27,0:08:41.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我滑倒擦伤了膝盖 -你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.40,0:08:41.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BUZZING]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.65,0:08:44.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The door to the stairwell of the other building was locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.65,0:08:44.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再者 隔壁大楼的楼梯门被锁住了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:47.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had to go down the fire escape, which ends on the third floor...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:47.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只好爬消防梯下去 它只能到三楼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:50.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...forcing me to crawl through the window of a lovely Armenian family...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:50.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}害我只好通过窗户爬进一个好心的亚美尼亚人家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:52.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who insisted I stay for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:52.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们坚持要我留下来吃午餐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.45,0:08:54.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That doesn't sound too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.45,0:08:54.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听起来还不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.91,0:08:59.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was eight courses of lamb. And they tried to fix me up with their son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.91,0:08:59.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}八道羊肉菜 他们还试图撮合我和他们的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.75,0:09:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sorry. -Not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.75,0:09:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真抱歉 -还没完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:04.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By the time I got to work, they'd given my shift away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:04.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我好不容易到我工作的餐厅时 他们已经把我的班给了别人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:08.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, that's right. I've lost an entire day's pay thanks to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:08.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 我一整天的收入泡汤了 都是因为这个玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.42,0:09:10.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-This.... -Time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.42,0:09:10.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这个… -时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.51,0:09:15.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The lights flash and the dish spins. Wanna try?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.51,0:09:15.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}灯会闪 碟子会转 你想试试吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.55,0:09:17.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.55,0:09:17.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:21.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't wanna try it. My God, you are grown men.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:21.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才不要试 老天 你们都是大人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.19,0:09:24.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How can you waste your lives with these stupid toys...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.19,0:09:24.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们怎么能把生命浪费在这些蠢玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.06,0:09:27.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and costumes and comic books, and now that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.06,0:09:27.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}服装和漫画书上呢？现在又搞那玩意？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.15,0:09:30.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That.... -Again, time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.15,0:09:30.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那个… -再说一次 时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:34.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, please, it's not a time machine. If anything, it looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:34.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 这才不是时光机 我看它比较像是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.53,0:09:37.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...something Elton John would drive through the Everglades.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.53,0:09:37.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾尔顿约翰在大沼泽地开的那种玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.29,0:09:45.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It only moves in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.29,0:09:45.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它只做时空移动
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.29,0:09:48.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It would be worse than useless in a swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.29,0:09:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它在沼泽里根本发挥不了作用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.47,0:09:58.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pathetic. All of you, completely pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.47,0:09:58.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无药可救 你们几个简直无药可救
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:04.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:04.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}该我了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.99,0:10:21.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, it's 2 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.99,0:10:21.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 现在是凌晨两点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.12,0:10:25.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So? -So it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.12,0:10:25.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-所以呢？ -所以轮到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.71,0:10:31.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why'd you set it for the day before yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.71,0:10:31.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么把它设定在前天？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.63,0:10:35.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because I wanna go back and keep myself from getting a time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.63,0:10:35.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我想回去阻止自己买时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:38.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't. If you were to prevent yourself from buying it in the past...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:38.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这行不通 你若要阻止过去的你买下它
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.85,0:10:42.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you would not have it available to stop yourself from buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.85,0:10:42.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你现在便没有时光机让你回去阻止自己买下它
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:46.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ergo, you would still have it. This is a classic rookie time-travel mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:46.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因此 你仍然保有它 这是很常见的时光机论点谬误
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.23,0:10:52.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I go back and prevent you from explaining that to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.23,0:10:52.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以回去阻止你这番解释吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:54.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Same paradox.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:54.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}同样的悖论
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.15,0:10:57.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you were to travel back in time and knock me unconscious...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.15,0:10:57.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你回到之前 比如把我打昏
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.12,0:10:59.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you wouldn't have the conversation that irritated you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.12,0:10:59.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们便不会有这段激怒你…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.66,0:11:02.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...motivating you to go back and knock me unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.66,0:11:02.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}激起你想要回到之前并打昏我的对话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.45,0:11:06.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if I knocked you unconscious right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.45,0:11:06.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我现在打昏你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.33,0:11:09.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It won't change the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.33,0:11:09.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那也不会改变过去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.84,0:11:13.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But it'd make the present so much nicer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.84,0:11:13.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但那会让现在好过许多
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.55,0:11:17.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you upset about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.55,0:11:17.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你因什么事心情不好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:19.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What was your first clue?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:19.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你从哪看出来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:22.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it was a number of things. First, the late hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:22.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有几个征兆 首先是这么晚了还没睡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:24.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then your demeanor seems very low-energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:24.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有你的样子有点无精打采
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.77,0:11:26.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Plus your irritability-- -Yes, I'm upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.77,0:11:27.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-再加上你烦躁的样子… -没错 我心情不好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.73,0:11:27.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.98,0:11:30.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't usually pick up on those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.98,0:11:30.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这种事我通常看不出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.94,0:11:32.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.94,0:11:32.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:36.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:36.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 你好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.28,0:11:38.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.28,0:11:38.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:42.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you wanna talk about what's bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:42.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想谈谈你的烦恼事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.91,0:11:46.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I don't know. Maybe. -Wow, I'm on fire tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.91,0:11:46.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不知道 也许吧 -哇 我今晚太强了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.13,0:11:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.13,0:11:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:58.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Girls like Penny never end up with guys who own time machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.96,0:11:58.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮那种女生绝对不会和拥有时光机的男生在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.47,0:11:59.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.47,0:11:59.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这我不同意
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.80,0:12:02.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Your inability to successfully woo Penny...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.80,0:12:02.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你无法成功追到佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.26,0:12:05.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...long predates your acquisition of the time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.26,0:12:05.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早在购得时光机之前就已是事实
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:10.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That failure clearly stands on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:10.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这份失败显然是独立存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.27,0:12:14.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thanks for pointing it out. -In addition, your premise is flawed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.27,0:12:14.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-多谢你指出来 -再说 你的前提有误
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.52,0:12:17.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In the original film, Rod Taylor got Yvette Mimieux...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.52,0:12:17.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在原版电影中 罗德泰勒就是用那台时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.57,0:12:19.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with that time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.57,0:12:19.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}赢得伊薇特米米亚克斯的芳心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.16,0:12:22.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In Back to the Future, Marty McFly got to hook up...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.16,0:12:22.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在《回到未来》里 马蒂麦克弗莱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.03,0:12:25.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with his extremely attractive young mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.03,0:12:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}则钓上了自己年轻貌美的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.37,0:12:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Those are movies. -Of course they're movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.37,0:12:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那些都是电影情节 -当然是电影情节
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:34.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you expecting an example involving a real-life time machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:34.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道你要我举现实世界里关于时光机的例子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:38.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:38.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太扯了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.93,0:12:41.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Come on, guys, push.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.93,0:12:41.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家加油 用力推
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.43,0:12:46.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: If I push any harder, I'm gonna give birth to my colon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.43,0:12:46.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我再用力推的话 我的大肠就要被推出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.85,0:12:48.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, hey, guys. -Hi, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.85,0:12:49.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 各位 -嗨 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.56,0:12:49.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[RAJESH AND HOWARD SCREAM]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:54.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Take a break, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:54.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家休息一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:55.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:55.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们在做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.82,0:12:59.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you know, just moving a time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.82,0:12:59.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么 我们只是在搬时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.24,0:13:02.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, okay, neat. But I really gotta get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.24,0:13:02.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 真好 但我得去上班了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:04.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:04.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.42,0:13:12.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.42,0:13:12.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抓住我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:15.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But what about your time machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:15.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你的时光机怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.04,0:13:18.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Some things are more important than toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.04,0:13:18.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有些事情比玩具更重要
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.31,0:13:27.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.31,0:13:27.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我好害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.97,0:13:30.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't worry, baby, I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.97,0:13:30.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别担心 宝贝 我保护你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.31,0:13:32.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.31,0:13:32.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喔 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.79,0:13:54.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's still my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.79,0:13:54.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在还是轮到我用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.26,0:14:01.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.26,0:14:01.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在做什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.76,0:14:03.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm packing up all my collectibles...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.76,0:14:03.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要把所有收藏品打包
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.43,0:14:06.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and taking them down to the comic-book store to sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.43,0:14:06.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后拿去漫画店卖掉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.47,0:14:08.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that really necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.47,0:14:08.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的有必要吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.35,0:14:11.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you need money, you can always sell blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.35,0:14:11.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你需要钱 你可以去卖血啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:14.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And semen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:14.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还可以卖精子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.23,0:14:16.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not about money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.23,0:14:16.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是钱的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.40,0:14:18.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We brought food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.40,0:14:18.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们带吃的来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.86,0:14:22.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lox and bagels, the breakfast of time travelers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.86,0:14:22.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}熏鲑鱼和百吉饼 时空旅行者的早餐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.07,0:14:24.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Terrific. Anyone wanna buy my share of the time machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.07,0:14:24.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真好 有谁想买我那份时光机拥有权吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.91,0:14:27.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why? -Because I don't want it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.91,0:14:27.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么？ -因为我不想要了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:29.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why? -Just personal reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:29.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么？ -私人理由
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.62,0:14:32.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My Spidey sense tells me this has something to do with Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.62,0:14:32.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的蜘蛛侠第六感告诉我此事和佩妮有关
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.21,0:14:35.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, do you wanna buy me out or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.21,0:14:35.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们到底要不要买下我那份？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.54,0:14:39.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll give you $100, which will make me half-owner, and we'll put it on my balcony.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.54,0:14:39.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我给你100美元 我取得一半所有权 我们把它放在我的阳台上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:42.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Screw his balcony. I'll give you 120 and put it in my garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:42.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去他的阳台 我给你120美元 放在我的车库里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.55,0:14:46.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I paid $200 for my share. -Everybody knows a time machine loses...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.55,0:14:46.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我那份是付了200美元的 -大家都知道一旦你开了时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.18,0:14:49.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...half its value the minute you drive it off the lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.18,0:14:49.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其价值便会减掉一半
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.64,0:14:52.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll go for 200. That time machine stays right where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.64,0:14:52.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我付200美元 时光机留在原地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.52,0:14:56.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Three hundred. And I'll throw in my original 1979 Mattel Millennium Falcon...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.52,0:14:56.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}300美元！我再额外奉送 1979年版星球大战千年隼号
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.27,0:14:58.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with real light-speed sound effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.27,0:14:58.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}具有真正的光速音效哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.31,0:15:03.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. No more toys or action figures or props or replicas...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.31,0:15:03.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 不要再提玩具或动作人偶或道具或复制品
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.19,0:15:06.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or costumes or robots or Darth Vader voice changers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.19,0:15:06.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或服装或机器人或黑武士的变声器
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.74,0:15:08.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm getting rid of all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.74,0:15:08.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要把它们都处理掉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:11.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't do that. Look what you've created.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能那样做 瞧你把这里营造的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.04,0:15:13.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like Nerdvana.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.04,0:15:13.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}简直就是书呆子天堂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:19.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}More importantly, you have a Darth Vader voice changer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:19.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}更重要的是 你有黑武士的变声器？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:23.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Not for long. -I call dibs on the Golden Age Flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:23.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-很快就不是我的了 -这个黄金时代手电筒我抢到了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.96,0:15:27.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I need that to complete my Justice Society of America collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.96,0:15:27.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 我需要它 这样我的美国正义联盟收藏才算齐全
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.14,0:15:28.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I called dibs. -You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.14,0:15:28.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真遗憾 我先抢到的 -你不能那样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.59,0:15:31.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can and I did. Look up "dibs" in Wikipedia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.59,0:15:31.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以 而且我做到了 你去维基百科查查什么叫“抢到”
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:34.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dibs doesn't apply in a bidding war.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:34.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}竞价投标不能用抢的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.35,0:15:38.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not a bidding war. I'm selling it all to Larry down at the comic-book store.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.35,0:15:38.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这不是竞价投标 我要把这些卖给开漫画店的拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.27,0:15:41.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why Larry? Did Larry call dibs? -Will you forget dibs?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.27,0:15:41.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么卖给拉里？他先抢到了吗？ -别提抢到了 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.40,0:15:43.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He offered me a fair price for the whole collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.40,0:15:43.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他愿意出公道价钱买下全部收藏品
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:48.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's the number? I'll match it. -I'll match it, plus 1000 rupees.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:48.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他出多少？我照付 -我也照付 外加一千卢比
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.41,0:15:52.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's the exchange rate? -None of your business. Take it or leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.41,0:15:52.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-兑换汇率是多少？ -不关你的事 要不要随你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.24,0:15:54.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Mom, my bar mitzvah bonds, how much do I got?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.24,0:15:54.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈 我的成年礼基金现在有多少钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.95,0:15:59.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks. I can go $2600 and two trees in Israel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.95,0:15:59.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢 我可以出2600美元 外加以色列的两棵树
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.67,0:16:04.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Forget it. Guys, if I sell to one of you, the other two are gonna be mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.67,0:16:04.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 如果我卖给你们其中一个 另外两个一定会生我的气
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.67,0:16:07.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who cares? As long as you pick me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.67,0:16:07.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁在乎？只要你卖给我就行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.80,0:16:10.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Leonard, put down the box. Let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.80,0:16:10.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 把箱子放下 我们好好谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.05,0:16:12.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry, Raj, my mind is made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.05,0:16:12.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 拉吉 我心已决
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.39,0:16:15.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. I can't let you do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.39,0:16:15.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 我不能让你这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.81,0:16:19.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.81,0:16:19.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 别挡我的路
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:24.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}None shall pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:24.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不得通行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.11,0:16:28.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.11,0:16:28.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.65,0:16:30.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I did not wanna do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.65,0:16:30.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我本来不想这么做的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:33.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I have here the rare, mint-condition, production-era...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:33.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有一个罕见的崭新错产
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.62,0:16:37.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Star Trek: The Next Generation Geordi La Forge without his VISOR...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.62,0:16:37.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《星际迷航：下一代》里没戴视觉辅助器的鹰眼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:38.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in the original packaging.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:38.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}原始包装
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.29,0:16:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you do not get out of my way...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.29,0:16:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们如果不让开
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:43.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I will open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:43.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就把它打开
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.59,0:16:46.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, man, be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.59,0:16:46.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 哥们 冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.30,0:16:49.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're all friends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.30,0:16:49.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们都是好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.18,0:16:51.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.18,0:16:51.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.97,0:16:54.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You hypocrite. -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.97,0:16:54.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你这伪君子 -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.76,0:16:57.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Little Miss Grown-Ups- Don't-Play-With-Toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.76,0:16:57.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好一个长大成人不玩玩具的大小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:17:01.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I went into that apartment right now, would I not find Beanie Babies?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:17:01.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我现在进去你的公寓 我有可能找不到豆豆娃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.14,0:17:04.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you not an accumulator of Care Bears and My Little Ponies?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.14,0:17:04.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道你没收藏爱心熊和可爱小马吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.19,0:17:07.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And who is that Japanese feline I see frolicking on your shorts?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.19,0:17:07.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有我看见的在你短裤上嬉戏的 那个日本猫科动物是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.28,0:17:10.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, Hello Kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.28,0:17:10.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好啊 凯蒂猫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.70,0:17:16.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, okay, look, if this is about yesterday, Leonard...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.70,0:17:16.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 莱纳德 如果事关昨天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.04,0:17:18.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I am really sorry about what I said. I was just upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.04,0:17:18.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的很抱歉我讲那些话 我只是当时心情很差
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.96,0:17:21.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No, I needed to hear it. -You didn't. You are a great guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.96,0:17:21.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我是需要被点醒 -不 你不需要 你人很好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.87,0:17:25.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And it is the things you love that make you who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.87,0:17:25.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是你所爱的东西造就了今天的你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.54,0:17:28.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess that makes me large breasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.54,0:17:28.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那这样我就是大胸弟了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.26,0:17:35.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Still, I think it's time for me to get rid of this stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.26,0:17:35.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我仍认为是我该处理掉这些东西的时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.22,0:17:38.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and, you know, move on with my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.22,0:17:38.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后 开始我新的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.22,0:17:41.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Really? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.22,0:17:41.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的吗？ -真的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.06,0:17:42.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:44.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:44.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.86,0:17:46.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.86,0:17:46.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.07,0:17:50.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, do you wanna, I don't know, later--?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.07,0:17:50.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 你晚点要不要…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:52.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:52.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}借过一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.36,0:17:53.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, Penny. -Hi, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.36,0:17:53.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 佩妮 -嘿 迈克
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.78,0:17:55.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You ready to go? -I just have to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.78,0:17:55.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你准备好了吗？ -我只要换个衣服就好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:17:58.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'll give you a hand. -Oh, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:17:58.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我来帮你吧 -哎呀 别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:00.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bye, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:00.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见 各位
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.58,0:18:01.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.96,0:18:07.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My turn on the time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.96,0:18:07.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}轮到我用时光机了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.02,0:18:30.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（802701年4月28日）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.11,0:18:32.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.11,0:18:32.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以用
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.99,0:18:35.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It really worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.99,0:18:35.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的可以用
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:39.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They said I was mad, but it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:39.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别人都说我疯了 但它真的可以用
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.17,0:18:48.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, not Morlocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.17,0:18:48.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 不要莫洛克人！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:51.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not flesh-eating Morlocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:51.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要吃人的莫洛克族！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.30,0:18:54.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Help!
