Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.77,0:19:09.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It is a little big for the living room, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.77,0:19:09.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放在客厅有点占空间 是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.19,0:19:12.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, that's the problem. It's too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.19,0:19:12.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 正是这个问题 它太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.11,0:19:15.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm glad you agree. I hired some guys to help us move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.11,0:19:15.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很高兴你同意了 我雇了几个人来帮我们搬走它
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.90,0:19:17.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on in, fellas.
